# AWS + Microsoft Entra ID SAML SSO Lab

## 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates SAML-based Single Sign-On (SSO) between Microsoft Entra ID and AWS IAM with role-based access control.

---

## 🧠 Key Concepts

* SAML 2.0 Federation
* Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
* Least Privilege Enforcement
* Identity Federation

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

![Architecture](architecture/saml-flow-diagram.png)

---

## ⚙️ Implementation Steps

### 1. Entra ID Configuration

* Created Enterprise Application
* Configured SAML SSO
* Defined App Roles:

  * AWS-Admin
  * AWS-ReadOnly

### 2. Claims Mapping

* Role → user.assignedroles
* RoleSessionName → user.userprincipalname

### 3. AWS Configuration

* Created SAML Identity Provider
* Configured IAM Roles:

  * AWS-Admin-SSO
  * AWS-ReadOnly-SSO
* Configured Trust Policy

---

## 🔐 Role Mapping Format

```text
arn:aws:iam::<ACCOUNT_ID>:role/<ROLE>,arn:aws:iam::<ACCOUNT_ID>:saml-provider/EntraID
```

---

