## 🧩 Challenges

* Incorrect SAML claim formatting caused authentication failures
* Required precise ARN mapping for role assumption
* Entra licensing limitation restricted multiple role assignments

---

## 🚀 Key Takeaways

* Implemented federated identity using SAML
* Enforced least privilege using AWS IAM
* Validated access controls through denial testing
